      483.2,
      295.52,
      601.28
    ],
    "text": "Six (06) allotments of lots in total extent of about 0.2254Hectares Shown as Lot Nos. 837 to 842, depicted in thePreliminary Plan No: FVP 388, Sheet No. 20, Supplement 21,dated 31.10.2017 prepared by the Surveyor - General situatedin the Village of Kotawera Pahalagama in a KotaweraPahalagama Grama Niladari Division of Dehivinipalatha KoraleMinor Division, in Division Secretary's Division ofUvaparanagama in the District of Badulla in Uva Province,morefully described below :",
